{"id":"000VL1","title":"Chaotic Archery","author":"Vythic","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-18T06:00:05+00:00","posted":"Heute, 06:19 Uhr","rules":"Play on SudokuPad!\n\nDigits are not repeated in any row, column, or region. The grid is divided into nine regions, each consisting of nine orthogonally connected cells containing the digits 1-9.\n\nDigits in a cage sum to the number in the top-left of the cage and cannot repeat. Within each cage, all digits of the same parity share the same region, and digits of opposite parities cannot share a region.\n\nThe digit on each arrow indicates exactly two of the following four rules:\n\n1) The number of cells in the indicated direction whose digits have the same parity as the arrow cell.\n\n2) The number of cells in the indicated direction whose digits have the opposite parity from the arrow cell.\n\n3) The number of consecutive cells immediately beyond the arrow cell in the indicated direction that belong to the same region as the arrow cell.\n\n4) The number of consecutive cells immediately beyond the arrow cell in the opposite direction that belong to the same region as the arrow cell.\n\nArrows do not count the arrow cell itself.","solutionCode":"Column 2, top to bottom, with a \"+\" between digits of different regions","tags":["Sudoku","Pfeile","Killer (Variante)","Chaos Construction (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/up0bqkgpg6","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/up0bqkgpg6","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":10,"hasSolution":true,"features":["arrows"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-18T06:00:05+00:00"}